</span><span id="S3.T2.2.6.1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="S3.T2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="S3.T2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.T2.p3.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
